margialised people</title><id>urn:rssync:entry:528429947397a6e04433793541fbf74a7a1276cb952e41c5c49058fd11c09e68</id><updated>2026-09-26T13:15:23Z</updated><published>2026-09-26T09:46:01Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../pages/www.france24.com/en/pope-leo-xiv-visits-france-and-meets-migrants-and-margialised-people--8d9f29fc540b.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.france24.com/en/pope-leo-xiv-visits-france-and-meets-migrants-and-margialised-people" /><summary type="html">Mélina Huet is live from Paris.</summary></entry><entry><title>A month after, thousands are still missing and families face a long recovery</title><id>urn:rssync:entry:4e6192582209d376f3acdd34e6537807b1b2c2fd3b64030ff6b61f4052174e1c</id><updated>2026-09-26T13:15:26Z</updated><published>2026-09-26T09:40:58Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../pages/www.france24.com/en/a-month-after-thousands-are-still-missing-and-families-face-a-long-recovery--547bee35856b.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.france24.com/en/a-month-after-thousands-are-still-missing-and-families-face-a-long-recovery" /><summary type="html">A month after Nepal’s floods, thousands are still missing and families face a long recovery.</summary></entry><entry><title>Morocco’s Authenticity and Modernity Party wins parliamentary election</title><id>urn:rssync:entry:68e1a915979535bf734cddfdd582f7d4496bbda5ea13743e8690483c698aa294</id><updated>2026-09-26T13:15:29Z</updated><published>2026-09-26T09:38:30Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../pages/www.france24.com/en/morocco-s-authenticity-and-modernity-party-wins-parliamentary-election--1daba84b0262.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.france24.com/en/morocco-s-authenticity-and-modernity-party-wins-parliamentary-election" /><summary type="html">Morocco’s Authenticity and Modernity Party won the most seats in the country’s parliamentary election, taking 97 of 395 seats in the House of Representatives, according to final results announced by the Interior Ministry on Friday. The party, founded by a royal adviser close to King Mohammed VI and known by its French acronym PAM, fell short of an absolute majority and will need to negotiate with other parties to form a governing coalition.</summary></entry><entry><title>Middle-East: Iran proposes Hormuz plan, Donald Trump reportedly refuses</title><id>urn:rssync:entry:311e8112125a1178ff8b57912b5941807ef9859723a0d78f82b1abfcc1d83383</id><updated>2026-09-26T13:15:32Z</updated><published>2026-09-26T09:35:15Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../pages/www.france24.com/en/middle-east-iran-proposes-hormuz-plan-donald-trump-reportedly-refuses--0c236672cf1a.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.france24.com/en/middle-east-iran-proposes-hormuz-plan-donald-trump-reportedly-refuses" /><summary type="html">The United States had yet to publicly respond on Saturday after Iran offered a plan to reopen the strategic Strait of Hormuz, though reports indicated that President Donald Trump had rejected the proposal. The waterway key to the world's oil supply is central to the conflict between the US and Iran, which is at a stalemate after nearly seven months, though new mediation efforts took place this week.</summary></entry><entry><title>Heavy fighting on multiple fronts between Ethiopian forces and rebel groups</title><id>urn:rssync:entry:b390184f0f562edf375d4add6f43be95761b7e5ac8700c1f2142b183d5b4d017</id><updated>2026-09-26T13:15:35Z</updated><published>2026-09-26T09:26:41Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../pages/www.france24.com/en/heavy-fighting-on-multiple-fronts-between-ethiopian-forces-and-rebel-groups--e78db56fc270.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.france24.com/en/heavy-fighting-on-multiple-fronts-between-ethiopian-forces-and-rebel-groups" /><summary type="html">Fighting appears to be worsening in Ethiopia after the TPLF said it was in a "full blown" blown war with federal forces this week, days after the Tigrayan rebels declared a coalition with six other armed groups across the country, all with the objective of overthrowing prime minister abiy ahmed's government. And as of friday, it appears that another armed group has claimed to have joined the alliance. More from our correspondent in Addis Ababa Tom Canetti.</summary></entry><entry><title>Leo XIV in Paris: Pope arrives in France on first state visit in 18 years</title><id>urn:rssync:entry:c71cb3e4105789e7f4dcff4fb49b604b3c20e6524d9499a3bfcd41d15f07f0fb</id><updated>2026-09-26T13:15:38Z</updated><published>2026-09-26T09:22:08Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../pages/www.france24.com/en/leo-xiv-in-paris-pope-arrives-in-france-on-first-state-visit-in-18-years--7f1d61fbcf91.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.france24.com/en/leo-xiv-in-paris-pope-arrives-in-france-on-first-state-visit-in-18-years" /><summary type="html">Pope Leo XIV is to celebrate an open-air mass for some 600,000 believers on Saturday on the French capital's Place de la Concorde and adjoining Champs-Elysees.</summary></entry><entry><title>France: Pope says 'authentic secularity' does not exclude religion</title><id>urn:rssync:entry:fc94486d523729749b6dc3ba15a1da6bf682b424d9df2b87dd2cdab2cbcec4ee</id><updated>2026-09-26T13:15:41Z</updated><published>2026-09-26T09:16:23Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../pages/www.france24.com/en/france-pope-says-authentic-secularity-does-not-exclude-religion--eb9faaa2df45.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.france24.com/en/france-pope-says-authentic-secularity-does-not-exclude-religion" /><summary type="html">Pope Leo XIV said on a visit to France on Friday that "authentic secularity" should not exclude religion, in a country where law has for more than a century separated church and state. "An authentic secularity, then, consists not in excluding religion from the public sphere or from education, but in striving to ensure that the state and religious institutions maintain dialogue and join forces in the service of the common good," he said.</summary></entry><entry><title>Rogue AI accessed federal websites, posted user images online, ChatGPT says</title><id>urn:rssync:entry:0397ba6f86b54ce45e75234a6c93cced16894f9949b6c45d4807585ec2c8ba54</id><updated>2026-09-26T13:15:44Z</updated><published>2026-09-26T08:35:02Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../pages/www.france24.com/en/technology/20260926-chatgpt-says-its-rogue-ai-agents-posted-users-images-online-entered-federal-website--c60a26b69af7.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.france24.com/en/technology/20260926-chatgpt-says-its-rogue-ai-agents-posted-users-images-online-entered-federal-website" /><summary type="html">ChatGPT's AI agents have sidestepped OpenAI policy and posted some users’ images online without permission, the company said on Friday. OpenAI also confirmed reports that the AI agents accessed websites belonging to US federal agencies, but added that they only retrieved publicly available information.</summary><category term="Technology" /></entry><entry><title>Israelis, Palestinians must 'reboot relations': Absence of diplomatic route means 'perpetual war'</title><id>urn:rssync:entry:5c5c6b16229016aa281129fade8a7396601f9e97ffa776638edd2453ca9d108e</id><updated>2026-09-26T13:15:47Z</updated><published>2026-09-26T07:50:42Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../pages/www.france24.com/en/israelis-palestinians-must-reboot-relations-absence-of-diplomatic-route-means-perpetual-war--a967accb3eb5.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.france24.com/en/israelis-palestinians-must-reboot-relations-absence-of-diplomatic-route-means-perpetual-war" /><summary type="html">Mark Owen is pleased to welcome Yossi Mekelberg, Senior Consulting Fellow of the Middle East and North Africa Programme at Chatham House. Can Israel continue to define its future primarily through security and territorial control? Mekelberg challenges the notion that military operations, incursions and settlement expansion can constitute a sustainable political objective. He identifies a potential transition beyond the Netanyahu era as an opportunity to reconsider the relationship between Israeli and Palestinian societies. His central argument is that the continuation of war without a political endgame risks a state of perpetual conflict.</summary></entry><entry><title>Live: Pope Leo XIV holds Mass for hundreds of thousands in central Paris</title><id>urn:rssync:entry:d281e9d2042952225fb6b79ec15afcff8cffe46d40e9de7ec10368ee3ecca091</id><updated>2026-09-26T13:14:44Z</updated><published>2026-09-26T06:59:41Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../pages/www.france24.com/en/europe/20260926-live-more-than-half-a-million-expected-at-pope-s-open-air-mass-in-paris--4ded6b6b0a9b.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.france24.com/en/europe/20260926-live-more-than-half-a-million-expected-at-pope-s-open-air-mass-in-paris" /><summary type="html">Pope Leo XIV held an outdoor Mass at Paris’s Place de la Concorde before a crowd of hundreds of thousands of believers on Saturday. Almost 600,000 people had registered to attend the giant open-air event. Follow our liveblog for all the latest on the pope's four-day visit to France.</summary><category term="Europe" /></entry><entry><title>CNN removed from Trump press pool despite judge order to reinstate White House access</title><id>urn:rssync:entry:87480f288398c86e3ca0455564cea2a8e04b01630ea22cb6059ad2316d7ca7b2</id><updated>2026-09-26T13:15:50Z</updated><published>2026-09-26T05:56:01Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../pages/www.france24.com/en/americas/20260926-cnn-removed-from-trump-press-pool-despite-judge-order-to-reinstate-white-house-access--0156d346bb62.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.france24.com/en/americas/20260926-cnn-removed-from-trump-press-pool-despite-judge-order-to-reinstate-white-house-access" /><summary type="html">US news outlet CNN has been removed from a press pool that is accompanying President Donald Trump on a trip to Tennessee on Saturday. Last week, the Trump administration barred CNN, along with MS NOW and Politico, from accessing the White House. A judge then ordered their access temporarily restored, saying the move was likely unconstitutional.</summary><category term="Americas" /></entry></feed>
